          <aside class="notes" hidden>
            <p>Each block links to the last: observation, image derivatives, report snapshot, optional signature. Missing captures are recorded, never hidden.</p>
            <p>Say the footer out loud. Integrity is not truth.</p>
          </aside>
        </section>

